<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1a2a52">
    <title>Przerwa techniczna – Classy Cash</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
    {# Fonts are cosmetic: when Google Fonts is unreachable the fallback stacks below take over. #}
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f7f6f0;
            --fg: #15203d;
            --muted: #6b7796;
            --primary: #1a2a52;
            --primary-2: #2a4a7a;
            --secondary: #2aa57f;
            --accent: #e8b441;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px 16px;
            font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(500px circle at 90% 8%, rgb(232 180 65 / 0.14), transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(600px circle at 6% 94%, rgb(42 165 127 / 0.16), transparent 70%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a52 0%, #2a4a7a 55%, #1f4a6a 100%);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.07);
            border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.18);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 44px 28px 36px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45);
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .brand .mark {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.2);
        }

        .brand .mark svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }

        .brand .name {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.9rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 2.8rem);
            line-height: 1.12;
        }

        h1 em {
            display: block;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: rgb(219 230 255 / 0.85);
        }

        .eta {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 10px 0 6px;
            padding: 9px 20px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgb(232 180 65 / 0.16);
            border: 1px solid rgb(232 180 65 / 0.45);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .bar {
            position: relative;
            height: 6px;
            margin: 26px auto 0;
            width: 160px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.15);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .bar::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0 auto 0 0;
            width: 40%;
            border-radius: inherit;
            background: var(--accent);
            animation: slide 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .note {
            margin: 22px 0 0;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.4);
        }

        @keyframes slide {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(250%); }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .bar::after { animation: none; width: 60%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <div class="brand">
        <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">
                <path d="M50 15L80 35V65L50 85L20 65V35L50 15Z" stroke="#e8b441" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/>
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="18" stroke="#e8b441" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M50 35V65M42 42H58M42 58H58" stroke="#e8b441" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="name">Classy Cash</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Przerwa techniczna<em>wracamy z klasą.</em></h1>
    <p>Wykonujemy prace serwisowe, dlatego aplikacja jest chwilowo niedostępna.</p>
{% if maintenance_eta | default('') | length > 0 %}
    <p class="eta">Wracamy: {{ maintenance_eta }}</p>
{% endif %}
    <p>Twoje dane i rozliczenia są bezpieczne. Zapraszamy za chwilę.</p>
    <div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="note">Created for Excellence</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
